        "darwin-arm64": "The native package builds a minimal headless arm64 binary from FFmpeg commit 9b6c8969e05b4f0b29f0f85cd501be6b3e582e6b, matching the pinned Linux and Windows runtimes. Third-party libraries are linked statically; Apple system frameworks remain dynamic.",
        "linux-x64": "The pinned BtbN GPL build is based on FFmpeg commit 9b6c8969e05b4f0b29f0f85cd501be6b3e582e6b. OCI and Windows binaries share one complete corresponding-source bundle.",
        "linux-arm64": "The pinned BtbN GPL build is based on FFmpeg commit 9b6c8969e05b4f0b29f0f85cd501be6b3e582e6b. OCI and Windows binaries share one complete corresponding-source bundle.",
        "windows-x64": "The BtbN build is based on FFmpeg commit 9b6c8969e05b4f0b29f0f85cd501be6b3e582e6b and its GPL dependency build scripts. Binary releases are blocked unless the complete corresponding-source bundle is attached."
